Bedrock texture path catalogue
Source: https://github.com/Mojang/bedrock-samples/tree/15701fa9c13923f12662984c32c124327e40e3d3/resource_pack/textures
Retrieved 2026-11-09 from the verified Git tree, revision 15701fa9c13923f12662984c32c124327e40e3d3.
